 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Laptops and equipment (POL-EQP-01): Every employee gets a company laptop, replaced every 3 years. A lost or stolen laptop or phone must be reported to IT within 24 hours so it can be locked and wiped; the helpdesk escalates these to IT. Full-time employees can claim a one-time home-office stipend of up to $300 through expenses. Personal devices may access email and team chat only, through the company app.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-EQP-01"
 ]
}
